---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import clinic from '../../assets/people/amelia-clinic.jpg';
import { routes } from '../../data/site';
---
<section class="section amelia" aria-labelledby="amelia-title">
  <div class="wrap amelia__grid">
    <figure class="amelia__photo" data-rise>
      <div class="photo">
        <!-- 1170 by 755 at source, so it is never shown wider than that. -->
        <Image src={clinic} widths={[480, 720, 1170]} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 44vw, 100vw" alt="Amelia Godfrey using an ultrasound machine with a man lying on a treatment bed in her clinic." />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="credit">Amelia Godfrey, pelvic health physiotherapist and Pelvy’s founder, in clinic.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="amelia__copy">
      <h2 class="h1" id="amelia-title" data-rise>Built by a physio, from what her patients asked for.</h2>
      <div class="stack body" data-rise style="--i: 1">
        <p>Amelia kept seeing the same thing. A patient would leave with good advice and a program, then struggle to keep up with it. The handout was lost, the email was buried, and nothing was counting for them.</p>
        <p>So she built Pelvy with patients, physiotherapists, GPs and specialists. She still sets up every clinic herself.</p>
      </div>
      <p data-rise style="--i: 2"><a class="link-strong" href={routes.about}>More about Amelia</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* The closing panel follows, with its own space above it. */
  .amelia { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .amelia__grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .amelia__photo { margin: 0; max-width: 1170px; }
  .amelia__photo .photo { aspect-ratio: 1170 / 755; }
  .amelia__copy { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .amelia__copy :global(.h1) { max-width: 15ch; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .amelia__grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 6fr); } }
</style>
